- crates/bbt-supervisor/src/supervisor.rs:858/:1714 — unknown seats may start at1 only with an unused destination ring. Higher first generation requires a valid existing predecessor boundary: bounded marker read/CRC/settings, then existing Ring::open identity/record validation. Unknown/empty/corrupt rings are never initialized by admission. Requested generation occupancy is rejected. Existing same-spec retry, conflict, capacity and W1.2e child registration are preserved.
